Package: halosimr
Title: HALO Event Exposure and Training Simulation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Dworkis", email = "dan@emergencymind.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulates high-acuity, low-occurrence (HALO) event exposure across
    a provider population and models readiness decay and training effects,
    extending the methodology of the Code Blue Blindspots paper (PMID 41633464).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/EmergencyMind/halosimr, https://emergencymind.github.io/halosimr/
BugReports: https://github.com/EmergencyMind/halosimr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
